## Sanity Studio core config
SANITY_STUDIO_PROJECT_ID="your-project-id"
SANITY_STUDIO_DATASET="development"
SANITY_STUDIO_STUDIO_HOST="" # Optional

## Sanity Presentation target
# Public site origin that Studio Presentation should open and connect to.
# This is the site URL, not the Studio URL.
# Trailing slash is fine; runtime normalizes it away.
SANITY_STUDIO_SITE_PREVIEW_URL="http://localhost:3000"
